@url=http://localhost:3000

### Registro de usuario
POST {{url}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Marcelo",
    "email": "marcelo@tp3.com",
    "password": "clave1234"
}

### Registro con datos inválidos (400)
POST {{url}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "M4rcelo",
    "email": "no-es-un-email",
    "password": "123"
}

### Registro con email ya existente (400)
POST {{url}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Demo",
    "email": "demo@tp3.com",
    "password": "demo1234"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "demo@tp3.com",
    "password": "demo1234"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Login con contraseña incorrecta (401)
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "demo@tp3.com",
    "password": "incorrecta1"
}

### Acceso sin token (401)
GET {{url}}/vehiculos

### Acceso con token
GET {{url}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
